        "t": {"item": "ds-console", "props": {"title": "Tartarus: the index", "kicker": "Records", "prompt": "Read the index", "flag": "readTartarusIndex", "once": false, "text": "PERMANENT SPECIMENS (“TITANS”) · EIGHT\n\nSynthids of the macroscopic line that do not senesce, do not die of injury and regenerate from residual tissue. Destruction has been attempted on each. It is not possible with present means. They are held.\n\nVAULT 1 · LEVIATHAN · source: A. VOSS\nVAULT 2 · BEHEMOTH · source: G. MOSS\nVAULT 3 · TIAMAT · source: I. BRANDT\nVAULT 4 · THE EYE · source: S. PELL\nVAULT 5 · THE CIRCLE OF WINGS · source: A. VOSS\nVAULT 6 · THE FROG · source: M. THALE\nVAULT 7 · THE CRYSTAL GARDEN · source: I. BRANDT\nVAULT 8 · THE HUNDRED-HANDED · source: all five\n\nMarket interest: nine governments, two private parties. See CONTAINMENT AS A PRODUCT."}},
        "v": {"item": "ds-console", "props": {"title": "Containment as a product", "kicker": "Records", "prompt": "Read the file", "flag": "fileTitans", "once": false, "text": "CONFIDENTIAL · BOARD ONLY\n\nThe Titans are not the product. The Titans cannot be sold; nobody can take delivery of one. The product is the cage.\n\nA buyer who holds a Tartarus holds the only proven means of keeping a Titan. A buyer who holds a Tartarus and a Titan holds a deterrent no one else can answer.\n\nWe propose to sell the first to everyone, and the second to whoever pays last.\n\n— A.V."}},
        "y": {"item": "ds-console", "props": {"title": "Line H", "kicker": "Records", "prompt": "Read the file", "flag": "fileLineH", "once": false, "text": "LINE H · “THE INHERITANCE”\n\nGrown from donor stock and from the board’s own tissue, selected over nine generations for intelligence, appetite and loyalty to source.\n\nThe first two of these goals were met.\n\nLine H refers to the board as its parents and to the rest of humanity as “the draft”. It has asked, politely and repeatedly, when it will be allowed to inherit.\n\nNote, I.B.: we are not, any of us, to be alone in a room with them."}},
