        "β": {"item": "ds-titan-plaque", "props": {"face": "s", "title": "Vault 5 · The Circle of Wings", "text": "THE CIRCLE OF WINGS · source: A. VOSS (REM cycle 3)\n\nIt loves. That is all it does, and all it is, and anything that goes within reach of its wings it loves to pieces. There have been eleven volunteers. They all went in smiling.\n\nNo one stands at the glass for longer than a minute."}},
