        "ζ": {"item": "ds-titan-plaque", "props": {"face": "s", "title": "Vault 8 · The Hundred-Handed", "text": "THE HUNDRED-HANDED · source: all five (a shared dream, recorded on a night none of them will discuss)\n\nFifty heads, a hundred hands. It cannot be kept behind glass: it pulls glass apart. Bronze holds it. Mostly.\n\nThe hands reach two metres through the bars. Walk on the far side of the hall."}},
