        "ι": {"item": "ds-titan-plaque", "props": {"face": "n", "title": "Vault 2 · Behemoth", "text": "BEHEMOTH · source: G. MOSS\n\nAs heavy as a lorry and harder to stop. It breathes fire, it paces, and when it sees something it charges it, glass or not. The glass has held eleven times.\n\nIt is the first vault the release console opens. Nobody remembers why it was set up that way."}},
