        "λ": {"item": "ds-titan-plaque", "props": {"face": "n", "title": "Vault 3 · Tiamat", "text": "TIAMAT · source: I. BRANDT\n\nLiving water: a single cell the size of a room. Its nucleus divides, and divides, and becomes one again, over and over; we don’t know what it is counting toward.\n\nIt seeds its young into the drains. The drains are being dealt with."}},
