        "Θ": {"item": "ds-titan-plaque", "props": {"face": "n", "title": "Vault 7 · The Crystal Garden", "text": "THE CRYSTAL GARDEN · source: I. BRANDT (REM cycle 7)\n\nIt grows over everything. Whatever living thing it touches, it grows into, and that thing becomes part of the garden: we have three of the vault crew in there, quite beautiful.\n\nThe glass is cracked. It is growing out. Nothing living touches Vault 7. Fire and a hard knock break it."}},
